        "text": "Welcome back. Today we prove that a to the n b to the n is not regular.",
        "intime": 0,
        "outtime": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "Assume for contradiction that L is regular and let p be the pumping length.",
        "intime": 12,
        "outtime": 28
      },
      {
        "text": "Choose s equals a to the p b to the p. The pumping lemma says s equals x y z.",
        "intime": 28,
        "outtime": 55
